%% Market data pipeline — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart LR
  Source[Provider records + revisions] --> Ingest[Adapter / cursor]
  Ingest --> Identity[Stable instrument identity]
  Identity --> Normalize[Normalize / timestamp / deduplicate]
  Normalize --> Validate{Valid and attributable?}
  Validate -->|No| Quarantine[Quarantine / health incident]
  Validate -->|Yes| Persist[Immutable observations / manifests]
  Persist --> Quality[Freshness and knowledge-time gates]
  Quality --> Features[Versioned feature snapshots]
  Quality -->|Not ready| Block[Block affected strategies]
  Persist --> History[Parquet history / DuckDB]
  Features --> Scanner[Scanner / Pods]

  Features --> Regime[Versioned deterministic regime / knowledge cutoff]
  Regime --> Scanner
